# bar_lure_hostile (task CE; docs/reference/PLAYTEST.md 1). The ksim_aggro_drop setup as a file: the player outside the Hub's Bar blackmarket,
# a Blood Raider patrol on the open ground past the door. They are always hostile, so the fight starts on sight: run in through the door and
# up (or kite in and out) and see whether the patrol follows you in, whether the crew joins, and whether the aggro comes off.
# Only the player is ever ordered (the scenario places the world; SCENARIO_IMPORT.md "Rule").
KSCEN 2
